Restrict access to the `/mcp` location block in the Nginx template by adding IP allowlists or requiring HTTP Basic Authentication:
```nginx
location /mcp {
  auth_basic "Restricted Area";
  auth_basic_user_file /etc/nginx/.htpasswd;
  proxy_pass http://{{ nginx_upstream_host | default('127.0.0.1') }}:{{ upstream_mcp_port }};
  # ...
}
```

